GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications?size=50
Authorization: Bearer {{leadToken}}

### 25. Файл от DEVELOPER — 201, Location и FileUploaded (включая самого инициатора)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/files
Authorization: Bearer {{developerToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=lab4-proof-boundary

--lab4-proof-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

< ./sample.txt
--lab4-proof-boundary--

> {% client.test("File created", () => client.assert(response.status === 201)); client.global.set("fileId", response.body.id); %}

